# Storybook

The kit MUST be fully Storybooked.

Every public export (token sets, atoms, molecules, organisms, templates) MUST have CSF3 stories. Required stories for a component: Default, each public variant, and each meaningful state the public API exposes (disabled, loading, error, focus where relevant). Tokens MUST have visual stories, not only JSON.

Story `title` MUST follow Atomic Design (`Atoms/Button`, `Tokens/Color`, `Organisms/Table`). Autodocs and the a11y addon MUST run on stories. A public component without stories MUST NOT merge.
